# Team code review

Follow `.ai-review/REVIEW.md` exactly (procedure, severity rubric, output format).
Rules live in `.ai-review/wiki/`; route via `.ai-review/wiki/index.md`.

- Gather context with `aireview context --base origin/main` and read
  `.ai-review/out/context.md`; if the CLI is missing, use REVIEW.md's fallback steps.
- Every finding cites a wiki rule ID or `general`, with exact evidence from a changed line.
- Write `.ai-review/out/findings.json`, run `aireview validate`, show the report.
- Do not edit files during the review.

@.ai-review/REVIEW.md
